{"key": "[\"At Panipat, in April 1526, Babur lashes his carts into a wall, sets his guns behind it, and sends his horsemen round the flanks. Ibrahim Lodi dies on the field. Babur had failed to hold Samarkand. He holds Hindustan instead, and complains in his memoir that it has no good horses, no grapes, no ice and no candles.\", \"sarvam:varun_en_suspense@en-IN\", \"+6%\", \"+0Hz\", {}, \"fx5\"]", "mp3": "/Users/saidevdhal/Desktop/Codes/indianepics/public/audio/en/panipat-1526.mp3", "duration": 23.652958, "words": [{"t": 0.0, "d": 0.4078096206896552, "w": "At"}, {"t": 0.4078096206896552, "d": 0.4078096206896552, "w": "Panipat,"}, {"t": 0.8156192413793104, "d": 0.4078096206896552, "w": "in"}, {"t": 1.2234288620689657, "d": 0.4078096206896552, "w": "April"}, {"t": 1.6312384827586208, "d": 0.4078096206896552, "w": "1526,"}, {"t": 2.039048103448276, "d": 0.4078096206896552, "w": "Babur"}, {"t": 2.4468577241379315, "d": 0.4078096206896552, "w": "lashes"}, {"t": 2.8546673448275866, "d": 0.4078096206896552, "w": "his"}, {"t": 3.2624769655172416, "d": 0.4078096206896552, "w": "carts"}, {"t": 3.6702865862068967, "d": 0.4078096206896552, "w": "into"}, {"t": 4.078096206896552, "d": 0.4078096206896552, "w": "a"}, {"t": 4.485905827586207, "d": 0.4078096206896552, "w": "wall,"}, {"t": 4.893715448275863, "d": 0.4078096206896552, "w": "sets"}, {"t": 5.301525068965518, "d": 0.4078096206896552, "w": "his"}, {"t": 5.709334689655173, "d": 0.4078096206896552, "w": "guns"}, {"t": 6.117144310344828, "d": 0.4078096206896552, "w": "behind"}, {"t": 6.524953931034483, "d": 0.4078096206896552, "w": "it,"}, {"t": 6.932763551724139, "d": 0.4078096206896552, "w": "and"}, {"t": 7.3405731724137935, "d": 0.4078096206896552, "w": "sends"}, {"t": 7.748382793103449, "d": 0.4078096206896552, "w": "his"}, {"t": 8.156192413793104, "d": 0.4078096206896552, "w": "horsemen"}, {"t": 8.56400203448276, "d": 0.4078096206896552, "w": "round"}, {"t": 8.971811655172415, "d": 0.4078096206896552, "w": "the"}, {"t": 9.